                           <td>The patient’s HbA1c is significantly elevated, indicating poor long-term glycemic control and likely uncontrolled diabetes. This increases the risk for microvascular and macrovascular complications, especially at her advanced age. Clinical correlation and optimization of diabetes management are recommended.</td>
